# Round 3 (Track T): the API key lives in the owner-only console
# settings file by default.  A plain .env at the repo root is the
# fallback for machines where the console flow is not desired.
#
# The key is NEVER read from a route, log line, error body, or
# bundle.  See docs/UNVERIFIED.md and the secrecy canary test
# (tests/test_config_secrecy.py) for the full contract.
#
# Set this to your Gemini key when you want real model output.
# Leave it commented for the honest simple-mode fallback (the
# default in this build).

# ADAPT_GEMINI_API_KEY=
